## Claude Code

The session guide is in AGENTS.md (imported above); keep shared rules there, and only
what is specific to Claude Code here.

- The audaxtech-workflow plugin's hooks are on in this project (`.claude/workflow.json`
  exists). The cwd-guard hook denies git-mutating commands run outside this repo, and the
  merge-gate hook denies `gh pr merge` unless CI is green. Both are a backstop for the
  rules in AGENTS.md, not a substitute for following them.
